---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../utils/categories';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description={`Terms of use for ${SITE_NAME} — nestlyraliving.com.`}
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <article class="container-editorial max-w-3xl py-10 sm:py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl text-ink sm:mt-3 sm:text-5xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">Last updated: August 5, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-editorial mt-8">
      <p>
        Welcome to {SITE_NAME} (“we”, “us”, “our”), operated at nestlyraliving.com. By accessing or
        using this website, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use
        the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial content</h2>
      <p>
        Articles, images, and product recommendations are for general inspiration and informational
        purposes. We do not guarantee that any design idea, product, or tip will suit your home,
        budget, or circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you purchase through those links, we may
        earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See our
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details. Product availability,
        pricing, and descriptions on retailer sites can change without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Unless otherwise noted, site design, branding, and original written content are owned by
        {SITE_NAME} or used with permission. You may not copy, republish, or commercially exploit
        substantial portions of the site without prior written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>User conduct</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to misuse the site, attempt to disrupt its operation, scrape content at a
        scale that harms performance, or use the site for unlawful purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
      <p>
        Links to Amazon and other retailers or services are provided for convenience. We are not
        responsible for the content, policies, or practices of third-party websites.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including
        fitness for a particular purpose or non-infringement, to the fullest extent permitted by
        law.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE_NAME} shall not be liable for any indirect,
        incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes are
        posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms:
        <a href="mailto:hello@nestlyraliving.com">hello@nestlyraliving.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
